<Site title="Privacy · Species bingo" description="Species bingo has no accounts, no tracking and no cookies. Your progress stays on your phone." heading="Privacy" path="/privacy/">
  <div class="site__body prose">
    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <p>Species bingo has no accounts, no tracking and no cookies. Nothing you do in a game, no mark or card, is sent anywhere. The only thing the site records is a count of page opens by country, with nothing that identifies you.</p>

    <h2>What is stored on your phone</h2>
    <p>Your cards, marks and hunt list are kept in this browser's local storage, so a card is still there when you come back. So are small settings, like whether you have dismissed the how-to card. This stays on your phone. We never see it.</p>

    <h2>Clearing it</h2>
    <p>Use Reset marks in a game to clear a card. To clear everything, clear this site's data in your browser settings.</p>

    <h2>Photos and links</h2>
    <p>Photos and fonts come from this site itself. The credits page links to the photo sources, and those sites have their own policies.</p>
  </div>
</Site>
